{"seq":10,"slug":"biomanufacturing","title":"生物制造","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing","introMarkdown":"# 生物制造 简介\n\n生物制造是一门融合合成生物学、代谢工程、生物过程工程与智能控制的新兴交叉学科，旨在利用生物体系（微生物、酶、细胞）替代传统化学工艺，实现从可再生原料到高附加值产品的绿色高效制造。2026年，天津大学等高校获批首批生物制造本科专业，标志着该领域进入系统化人才培养阶段。国家\"十五五\"规划将生物制造列为\"未来产业\"重点方向与关键核心技术攻坚领域。\n\n本教程面向生物工程、化学工程、生物技术及相关交叉学科的本科高年级学生与研究生，也适合有志于进入合成生物学产业的工程技术人员。学习者应具备基础分子生物学、有机化学与微生物学知识。\n\n全书分为四章，覆盖从基础理论到产业转化的完整链条：\n\n第一章**合成生物学基础**介绍基因组设计与合成、基因回路工程以及底盘细胞构建的核心方法论，为后续代谢改造奠定分子工具基础。\n\n第二章**代谢工程与细胞工厂**聚焦代谢通路设计、酶工程与生物催化、以及人工细胞工厂的系统构建策略，展示如何将设计思路转化为高产工程菌株。\n\n第三章**生物制造工艺与装备**从生物反应器动力学、生物分离工程到智能过程控制，阐述如何将实验室成果放大为可工业化运行的制造系统。\n\n第四章**产业应用与前沿**覆盖生物燃料与化学品、生物材料与生物塑料、生物医药与食品制造三大应用领域，呈现生物制造在全球碳中和与循环经济中的战略价值。\n\n推荐学习路径：先掌握第一章的合成生物学工具箱，再通过第二章理解设计-构建-测试-学习（DBTL）循环，接着学习第三章的工程放大逻辑，最后在第四章中建立产业视野与前沿感知。鼓励结合实验室实践与计算工具同步推进。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthetic-biology-foundations","title":"合成生物学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"genome-design-synthesis","title":"基因组设计与合成","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/genome-design-synthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gene-circuit-design","title":"基因回路设计","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/gene-circuit-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chassis-cell-engineering","title":"底盘细胞工程","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/synthetic-biology-foundations/chassis-cell-engineering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"metabolic-engineering","title":"代谢工程与细胞工厂","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"metabolic-pathway-design","title":"代谢通路设计","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/metabolic-pathway-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"enzyme-engineering","title":"酶工程与生物催化","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/enzyme-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cell-factory-construction","title":"人工细胞工厂构建","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/metabolic-engineering/cell-factory-construction"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"bioprocess-equipment","title":"生物制造工艺与装备","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bioreactor-dynamics","title":"生物反应器动力学","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioreactor-dynamics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bioseparation-engineering","title":"生物分离工程","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/bioseparation-engineering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intelligent-bioprocess-control","title":"智能生物过程控制","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/intelligent-bioprocess-control"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"industrial-applications","title":"产业应用与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"biofuels-biochemicals","title":"生物燃料与化学品","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biofuels-biochemicals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biomaterials-bioplastics","title":"生物材料与生物塑料","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biomaterials-bioplastics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biopharmaceuticals-food","title":"生物医药与食品制造","url":"/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biopharmaceuticals-food"}]}]}